(2,'🟡',"Collect and use user feedback: thumbs, edits, regenerate, copy and abandon as implicit signals, how do you attach them to traces, what biases they carry (low response rate, negativity bias), and how do they feed eval sets and alerts?",f"product companies, GenAI startups; Phoenix and LangSmith docs describe annotations and feedback; {G}"),
