(1,'🟡',"Code: write a tracing decorator for LLM calls in plain Python: nested spans with ids and parents, timing, token counts, cost from a price table, error capture, and a pluggable exporter (list or JSON lines), tested on a mock model.",f"product companies, platform teams, live-coding rounds"),
(1,'🟡',"Code: build a prompt registry with immutable versions, labels (staging, production), promote and rollback, a fetch-with-cache client and a fallback prompt, and tests that rollback restores the exact previous text.",f"product companies, platform teams, live-coding rounds"),
